	(text "PT1000 4-wire ratiometric: IDAC1 (AIN3) excites through 1k (1.5 V at 250 uA if the cable shorts), AIN1/AIN0 sense, Rref (3.9k) on REFP0/REFN0. SPI mode 1 on the main bus (CS from the decoder), internal oscillator (CLK tied low)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "23f5669d-be84-50b4-96f6-7aab989ac5d6")
	)
	(text "DRDY is not connected: firmware polls the conversion. The ESD clamp sits on the connector side of the 1k resistors; 10 nA of leakage is about 0.01 K."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 21 0)
		(effects
